This file marks an installed copy of HexEngine.

Its presence tells the engine the install folder is read-only (Program Files),
so per-user state - logs, the recent-projects list, caches and generated
shaders - goes to %LOCALAPPDATA%\HexEngine instead of beside the executables.
The installer adds it; the portable ZIP deliberately does not (a portable copy
keeps everything in its own folder). Do not delete it.
